{"reviews":[{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-0","r":5.0,"t":"\ud83d\ude4c\ud83c\udffd","x":"I have spent a lot of money trying to find the perfect hair product for my self and i am so glad I found this company. The scent from the pomades are amazing, they keep my hair in place all day. The price for this kit is incredible especially for the size of each product in the box other than that I would recommend this box it won't disappoint \ud83d\udc4c\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffd Thank you","h":24,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-1","r":5.0,"t":"Without a doubt the best hair products I have used","x":"Without a doubt the best hair products I have used. i have tried a lot of different hair products and given that I am active duty military I need something that will hold up and still look great. Suavecito has not let me down yet. If you looking for great pomade stop looking...YOU FOUND IT! This stuff smells great, one thing that I also love is that if I accidentally mess my hair up I can just get a comb wet and fix it. Most pomades I have used crumble once dried and you try to recomb, this does","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-2","r":5.0,"t":"Fast delivery","x":"The best product around and it was delivered in 2 days!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great Products, Great Gift","x":"We ordered this gift set as a Christmas present for our teenage nephew who is really into haircare. My husband loves the pomade, so he knew it would be the perfect gift. It smells great and has an excellent hold. My husband hasn't personally used any of the other products, but our nephew absolutely loves it. He keeps it hidden so his brother and mom don't try to use it!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-4","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Every product does exactly what it says. It really hardens the hair and kepts it slick.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-5","r":5.0,"t":"Orale Suavecito market to the longhairs!","x":"I have long hair which is wavy, after a shower I brush in three squirts of the creme into my towel dryer hair. Once it has dried a bit more I massage and  brush in three grape sized of the pomade until it has spread all over. Then I put it into a pony tail which is then braided by my wife and it looks FIRME! Lasts all day no fly aways and smooths out if needed by hand. If my day will be particularly windy after it is braided or ponytailed I spray the hair spray liberally all around and SAS!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-6","r":5.0,"t":"natural look and perfect shine to your hair","x":"This hair product is very unique and can be used on hair of all ethnicity. If you want a firm hold, natural look and perfect shine to your hair, this product is recommended highly.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great!","x":"Great product, makes for a perfect style every time. Smells awesome and you can keep hair soft and flowing, not stiff, unless you want it to!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-8","r":5.0,"t":"Get more pay less","x":"Make your hair Smell Good and Look Good. I use it for a comb over or slick back and I personally like it because it comes with 5 items a comb, regular Suavecito Pomade, Suavecito Pomade Firme Hold (Stronger Hold), Suavecito Brilliant creme, and A Suavecito Grooming Spray. Get more and pay less.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-9","r":5.0,"t":"Good variety","x":"I had no idea to order as I have not had more than a quarter inch of hair for years. This is a great way to figure out what is out there, and what works for me. So far I like the Brilliant Creme the best as it is the easiest to work with for me.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-10","r":4.0,"t":"Good value","x":"For the price it is a great value but I found myself not really using the cream and the spray. If you use they're products a lot this is a good set regardless my first time ever trying suavecito and it was better than what I expected.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-11","r":5.0,"t":"2 Thumbs way up.","x":"Shipping was fast on top of all that this is a care package for all hair enthusiasts. It has all the utensils you need for hair grooming and gives out a nice aroma. I must say that suavecito is the best product for my hair by far.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-12","r":5.0,"t":"Get it HOMBRE!","x":"Been wanting to try the Brilliantcreme and so far it is great. Been using the pomade for a while now and have found nothing that even compares for this price. Easily matches the quality of products that cost twice as much.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-13","r":5.0,"t":"Satisfied and great product.","x":"I bought this and I absolutely love it. It arrived fast. Smells so good all day long. The firm hold really is firm hold just use a little bit of it. And came with lots of stickers and extras. Thank you guys.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-14","r":4.0,"t":"Suavecito is a good product brand.","x":"I thought the box was bigger, as it shows on the front picture, but I think it\u2019s okay. The rest of the products are good. My husband loves the company so I thought this could be good for him. He loved it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-15","r":5.0,"t":"Everything works great. Nice packaging and this kit will probably last ...","x":"Everything works great. Nice packaging and this kit will probably last me an entire year. Usually use crew but this is definitely my new favorite","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-16","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome!","x":"This is by far the best line of products I've ever used for my hair. The look, the feel, the smell! Definitely on another level.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-17","r":5.0,"t":"Esta chingon","x":"I love this product it smells good and really holds well! I honestly just use the pomade and my 3 year old daughter use the rest","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-18","r":5.0,"t":"A really good deal, when compared to buying each item individually","x":"A really good deal, when compared to buying each item individually. The smell is addicting. I'm close to ordering my second box.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-19","r":5.0,"t":"... boyfriend only uses susvecito and he was absolutely in love with the gift set","x":"My boyfriend only uses susvecito and he was absolutely in love with the gift set. He loves all the products","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great Value!","x":"If you haven't tried Suavecito before this is a great value to try out all their available products.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-21","r":5.0,"t":"Hell of a deal","x":"This box was far beyond my expectations. My wife stole the hair spray, unbenounced to me lol","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-22","r":5.0,"t":"... just trying a differ t brand this kit is awesome!","x":"If you're new to pomade or just trying a differ t brand this kit is awesome!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-23","r":5.0,"t":"... just trying a differ t brand this kit is awesome!","x":"If you're new to pomade or just trying a differ t brand this kit is awesome!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01I5MFUZ4-24","r":5.0,"t":"... just trying a differ t brand this kit is awesome!","x":"If you're new to pomade or just trying a differ t brand this kit is awesome!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers consistently praise the products' scent, describing it as great and long-lasting.","cites":[1,4,8,9,12,14]},{"text":"Many reviewers highlight strong hold and performance, noting it keeps hair in place all day and provides firm hold.","cites":[1,2,4,5,7,14]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the kit as great value for the price, with good variety and quality matching more expensive products.","cites":[1,9,11,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers mention fast shipping and delivery.","cites":[3,12,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers note they did not use all the included products, such as the cream and spray.","cites":[11,15]}]},"qa":[]}